TRING_HEADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"},{"startIndex":456,"length":40,"headerMapping":"ATTRIBUTED_STRING_HEADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"},{"startIndex":496,"length":754,"headerMapping":"ATTRIBUTED_STRING_HEADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"},{"startIndex":1250,"length":9,"headerMapping":"ATTRIBUTED_STRING_HEADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"},{"startIndex":1259,"length":1,"headerMapping":"ATTRIBUTED_STRING_HEADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"},{"startIndex":1260,"length":5,"headerMapping":"ATTRIBUTED_STRING_HEADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"},{"startIndex":1265,"length":1,"headerMapping":"ATTRIBUTED_STRING_HEADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"},{"startIndex":1266,"length":5,"headerMapping":"ATTRIBUTED_STRING_HEADER_MAPPING_UNSPECIFIED"}],"backgroundColorStyle":"BACKGROUND_COLOR_STYLE_COLOR_SAMPLED","lightThemeColorPalette":{"baseBackground":4293984254,"raisedBackground":4293984254,"additiveBackground":558221760,"textPrimary":4278859315,"textSecondary":4281889133,"invertedBackground":4279664247,"overlayBackground":3423221299},"darkThemeColorPalette":{"baseBackground":4278328346,"raisedBackground":4278859315,"additiveBackground":725993920,"textPrimary":4292934393,"textSecondary":4289453787,"invertedBackground":4286440412,"overlayBackground":3423221299},"colorSampledDescriptionBodyText":{"content":"「ULTIM@TE☆BE∀M!!」\n\nプロジェクトセカイ カラフルステージ！ feat. 初音ミク\nプロジェクトセカイ Championship 2026 in プロセカ感謝祭\n決勝 書き下ろし楽曲\nhttps://pjsekai.sega.jp/championship2...\n\n\nMusic / Lyrics:\nxi  \n  / com_giko_31  \n   / @xiofficial   \n\nVocal: \n初音ミク\n\nMovie / Illust / Animation:\nTOYCAT\n  / gyalaxtoycat  \n   / @toycat9688   \n\nIllust / Animation:\nこぎのきゐ \n  / kiro247  \n\nうつうつつ\n  / uuchan_dazo  \n\n\nストリーミング：https://linkco.re/09QH755a\n\nオフボーカル+歌詞：https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/46wt8i...\n\nニコニコ動画版：https://www.nicovideo.jp/watch/sm4686...\n\n\n-------------------------------------------------\nULTIM@TE☆BE∀M!!\n\nWake up, Beam Maniacs\nRise up, Beam Maniacs\nStand up, Beam Maniacs\nIgnite, the ULTIM@TE☆BE∀M!!\n\n抗えない衝動に\nDesire 最強無敵の一撃を\n\n救われない暴走に\nPrayer 運命(さだめ)捻じるエクスマキナ\n\n崩れゆく世界 歪んでく未来\n終末へ加速するカタルシス\nすべてを打ち砕く 逆転のTrigger\n限界を越えて\n\n収束完了 臨界突破 ミク、撃ちます！\n\nULTIM@TE☆BE∀M!!\nULTIM@TE☆BE∀M!!\n\nYo Yo Yo！ どんなビームが好きですか？\n曲射！ 反射！ 乱射！\nぶっとい直線！\n魂こもったセリフと同時に発射！\n撃って時間差大爆発！\nプラズマ！ ストーム！ オーラ纏って！\n詠唱 魔法陣展開！\n杖から！ 口から！ 目から！笑顔で！\n止められない やめられない\n撃ったもん勝ち トリガーハッピー！\n\nせーのっ！\nULTIM@TE☆BE∀M!!\nULTIM@TE☆BE∀M!!\n全て薙ぎ払う\n幕引きのRadiance\n\nULTIM@TE☆BE∀M!!\nULTIM@TE☆BE∀M!!\n三千世界へ ぶちかませ！\n\nULTIM@TE☆BE∀M!!\n\nWake up, Beam Maniacs\nRise up, Beam Maniacs\nStand up, Beam Maniacs\nIgnite, the ULTIM@TE☆BE∀M!!\n-------------------------------------------------\n\n#VOCALOID #プロセカ #初音ミク","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":100,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAYiEwi3voSTwM-XAxVPf_UHHVABGRhI6JeXqt6Sr-lUygEEaTShEg==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUlxb01IYjJnUDJJS0ZvLVlMeWRQekcta0IxT3xBSTVJdTV2cXZXaFA1SmNjZEJWeW8wUjVTTVdKeGpkYTlXTkVRaGUwS1hGM2JfZHNaNzVnX2FBQXNodG5ReF9VdE05TGJUdkpTZTB0RUZxcnRVYVpib2xta19qM3BWUm9LOW44\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fpjsekai.sega.jp%2Fchampionship2026%2Findex.html\u0026v=VNK8leVFy-g","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUlxb01IYjJnUDJJS0ZvLVlMeWRQekcta0IxT3xBSTVJdTV2cXZXaFA1SmNjZEJWeW8wUjVTTVdKeGpkYTlXTkVRaGUwS1hGM2JfZHNaNzVnX2FBQXNodG5ReF9VdE05TGJUdkpTZTB0RUZxcnRVYVpib2xta19qM3BWUm9LOW44\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fpjsekai.sega.jp%2Fchampionship2026%2Findex.html\u0026v=VNK8leVFy-g","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":164,"length":17,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAYiEwi3voSTwM-XAxVPf_UHHVABGRhI6JeXqt6Sr-lUygEEaTShEg==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUlxb01IWnlTT05GX191X0dIUUxDVTJtLVZwQXxBSTVJdTVzaldCYVdIT1lEbUFRNHJVdEVkemxILUpvSUpHamNFcW9kblF